-22. 论文中允许的创新表述
-建议主贡献句：We formulate historical-state selection in RGB-T tracking as a cross-modal retrieval-authority problem and introduce an asymmetric paired-state retrieval policy, where the modality with stronger retrieval evidence controls historical-state selection while the counterpart modality can only support or abstain from the switch.
-中文建议：我们将 RGB-T 跟踪中的历史状态选择重新表述为跨模态检索控制权问题，并提出非对称成对状态检索机制：由当前检索证据更强的模态控制历史状态选择，另一模态仅能提供一致性支持或促使系统保持当前状态。
-禁止使用的主张："first reliability-guided template memory"、"novel multimodal template update"、"novel reliability network"、"theoretical guarantee of drift prevention"、"training-free learned calibrator"、"fully label-free method"。这些说法会放大撞车或严谨性风险。准确表述是：no additional network training; label-free empirical-CDF fitting; validation-tuned decision thresholds。
